  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lcc22tx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"325\"></p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2>您是否正在尋找為世界增添更多刺激的頭目戰？本模組旨在打造史詩級的終局頭目戰。</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">這是 Barribob 的「Bosses of Mass Destruction」模組從 Fabric 移植到 Forge 的非官方版本。點擊<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>前往原始專案。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目前本模組包含四位頭目。</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>夜之巫妖</strong>，出現在寒冷生態系的罕見高塔中。跟隨靈魂之星即可找到這些高塔。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>黑曜石石柱</strong>，出現在終界島嶼的罕見結構中。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>地獄鐵手套</strong>，出現在地獄的罕見結構中。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>虛空之花</strong>，出現在世界最深處的罕見洞穴中。虛空百合會指引方向。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">創造模式下可透過 /summon 指令召喚。</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">安裝方式：<br><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以一般 Forge 模組方式安裝，並需安裝以下前置模組。</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cerbons-api-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">CERBON's API (1.20.1+)</a></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib</a></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">支援</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">請將所有錯誤、問題及功能請求回報至<a href=\"https://github.com/CERBON-MODS/Bosses-of-Mass-Destruction-FORGE/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a>，或使用我的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2PvYZfjWDf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>在適當頻道回報。留言區僅供留下對模組的評論或簡單問題。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在回報錯誤、問題或功能請求前，請先閱讀<a href=\"https://github.com/CERBON-MODS/Bosses-of-Mass-Destruction-FORGE/blob/master/FAQ.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">常見問題</a>。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">其他專案</span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我還有其他模組您可能會感興趣：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-totem-of-undying-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Totem of Undying [FORGE]</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-totem-of-undying-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Totem of Undying [FABRIC]</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sugared-concrete-powder\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sugared Concrete Powder [FORGE]</a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/queen-bee\" rel=\"nofollow\">Queen Bee [FORGE]</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cerbons-better-beacons-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Better Beacons [FORGE]</strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-beacons-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Beacons Reforged</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">需要伺服器嗎？</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fCerbon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/CERBONs_Better_Totem_of_Undying/BH_CBTU_promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"250\"></a></span></p>",
